1. [BLOCKER] src/bytecode/vm.rs:3284 — unknown kind collapses to `None` (untyped) and matches everything, contradicting the comment at src/bytecode/vm.rs:3278 and docs/BYTECODE.md:144 claiming it matches nothing — concrete fix: distinguish unknown from untyped (e.g. `Option<Option<FailureKind>>` with unknown declining all) instead of `and_then(FailureKind::from_name)`
